## {#process .aoa-slide}

::: {.aoa-shell}
::: {.aoa-topbar}
::: {.aoa-section-label}
DISCUSSION
:::
::: {.aoa-heading}
A process heuristic the room can use
:::
:::

::: {.aoa-content}
::: {.process-grid}
::: {.process-card}
<div class="process-number">01</div>
<div class="process-title">Earlier</div>
Discuss the process before expectations harden and before the work is nearly complete.
:::
::: {.process-card}
<div class="process-number">02</div>
<div class="process-title">Explicitly</div>
State what contributions are expected and what authorship requires.
:::
::: {.process-card}
<div class="process-number">03</div>
<div class="process-title">Transparently</div>
Make the basis for decisions visible enough that people can understand the outcome.
:::
::: {.process-card}
<div class="process-number">04</div>
<div class="process-title">Revisited</div>
Update the plan as actual contributions evolve.
:::
:::

::: {.aoa-bottom-line}
Decide the process early — not necessarily the final byline.
:::
:::
